1
00:00:23,744 --> 00:00:28,483
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,483 --> 00:00:32,195
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,419 --> 00:00:34,664
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,011 --> 00:00:37,718
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,597 --> 00:00:43,125
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:46,757
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,235 --> 00:00:50,723
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,867 --> 00:00:55,363
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,363 --> 00:01:00,003
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,391 --> 00:01:02,051
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,051 --> 00:01:08,003
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,195 --> 00:01:11,883
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,883 --> 00:01:15,454
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,619 --> 00:01:22,563
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,011 --> 00:01:26,632
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,632 --> 00:01:30,316
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,403 --> 00:01:35,331
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,331 --> 00:01:39,491
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,235 --> 00:01:46,787
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,331 --> 00:01:49,987
=Episode 23=

21
00:01:50,255 --> 00:01:52,846
(Hechang Photography)

22
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:04,000
I'm here for Paramount's
new dancer photos.

23
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:09,120
Excuse me. I'd like to ask.

24
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:12,360
Wasn't the Paramount already closed down
and turned into a girls' school?

25
00:02:12,719 --> 00:02:13,560
What do you mean?

26
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,879
The business is booming.

27
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:17,360
A girls' school?
What do women need to study for?

28
00:02:17,479 --> 00:02:18,639
Their rightful job

29
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:20,039
is to dance and please men.

30
00:02:24,896 --> 00:02:26,048
(Medicine Investigation Report)

31
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:31,800
A few days ago, I informed
the Fengcheng Chamber of Commerce

32
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:34,599
to close the Paramount
and establish a girls' school.

33
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,520
How does it go?

34
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:40,159
Everything is proceeding
according to your instructions.

35
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:43,680
After it's done, we will
definitely inform you, Miss Jiang.

36
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,719
Manager Lu of the Fengcheng Bank,

37
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:51,800
first of all, you should address me
as President Jiang.

38
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:56,879
Secondly, you should report regularly
on the tasks I've assigned,

39
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:59,520
instead of pretending to listen
while brushing me off

40
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:01,080
and informing me afterward.

41
00:03:01,919 --> 00:03:04,800
Are you here to assert
your authority over us today?

42
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:07,400
We are all influential people
in the Chamber.

43
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:11,439
Jiang Chun'er, you have to listen
to whatever we say.

44
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:14,400
Do you actually think you're the head
of Fengcheng Chamber of Commerce?

45
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:17,319
What qualifications does a mere woman
have to stand above us?

46
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:20,759
My Jiang family holds the top position
in Fengcheng Chamber of Commerce

47
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:22,479
because we have the ability to.

48
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:25,240
Half of all the shops
and industries in Fengcheng

49
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,560
bear the Jiang name.

50
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:29,479
Who gave you the nerve
to spout nonsense in front of me?

51
00:03:29,479 --> 00:03:33,039
Bah! How dare you wretch scold us?

52
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:35,240
Listen to me, Jiang Xiaoren is dead.

53
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:37,599
The shops in our hands
should now bear our names.

54
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:39,201
That's what your Jiang family owe us.

55
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:45,400
All the dirty deeds you've done
over the years are recorded here.

56
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,680
If these get out,

57
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:48,840
even ten lives
wouldn't be enough to save you.

58
00:03:48,896 --> 00:03:50,048
(Medicine Investigation Report)

59
00:03:56,960 --> 00:04:02,159
From today on, you will carry out
every task I assign diligently.

60
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,680
Shut down Paramount

61
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,080
and found a girls' school.

62
00:04:05,639 --> 00:04:09,240
Also, all our merchant ships
must dock and anchor.

63
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,360
No foreign ships are allowed to dock.

64
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,039
Yes.

65
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,160
Let's go.

66
00:04:23,959 --> 00:04:25,920
Miss Jiang,
you were so amazing just now.

67
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,879
I've been watching long enough.

68
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:32,560
Hong'er, do everything as I instructed.

69
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:34,480
If Xu Fan still needs money,

70
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,920
he won't offend my family so easily.

71
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,839
Wait for me to come back.

72
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:38,759
Alright.

73
00:04:47,839 --> 00:04:48,720
What are you thinking?

74
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:53,959
I'm thinking

75
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:59,759
what our life would be like
if we weren't born in this chaotic era

76
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:01,560
and could grow up safely.

77
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:04,120
I don't think about those things.
I only focus on the present.

78
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:05,983
So what if it's a chaotic era?

79
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,879
As long as I can stay
in this broken temple,

80
00:05:09,439 --> 00:05:11,160
this moment is the most carefree time.

81
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,480
(If I die,)

82
00:05:19,319 --> 00:05:22,399
(you must live well for me.)

83
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,240
Xu Fan might move the deal up.

84
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,240
If Xu Fan makes the deal in advance,

85
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:42,800
then the Chamber's ships
can only hold them off for a while.

86
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:46,160
So we have to get the Jade Buddha Head
before they make the deal.

87
00:05:46,839 --> 00:05:48,319
There's no time for a thorough plan.

88
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,839
We'll take action tonight.

89
00:05:50,319 --> 00:05:51,800
If we can't get away then,

90
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:55,360
we can hide the Jade Buddha Head
in the secret passage of Master's room.

91
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:58,839
And Chun'er, you'll be our backup.

92
00:05:59,439 --> 00:06:01,199
Get there before dawn.

93
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,680
If the Jade Buddha Head is there,

94
00:06:03,399 --> 00:06:04,839
no matter what happens to us,

95
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:07,480
take the Jade Buddha Head
and leave first.

96
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,160
Our national treasures
must be kept in China.

97
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:32,480
You must have been mischievous

98
00:06:32,959 --> 00:06:34,720
and punished outside
by your master so often

99
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,759
that you found this secret passage.

100
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:41,000
At least it's come in handy now.

101
00:07:00,759 --> 00:07:01,600
It's explosives.

102
00:07:12,199 --> 00:07:13,480
There are explosives everywhere.

103
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:16,274
These explosives don't definitely
belong to the Rongqing Troupe.

104
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:19,759
It's Xu Fan. He...

105
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:20,600
President Du,

106
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:24,759
you've seen the Jade Buddha Head.
Time to let the arms ship dock, right?

107
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:26,519
Xu Fan indeed moved the deal up.

108
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:29,240
Xu Fan set the deal location here

109
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,916
and planted explosives in advance.

110
00:07:31,959 --> 00:07:32,759
It seems

111
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,560
he plans to double-cross.

112
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,360
Let's go.

113
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:43,480
Governor Xu, you brought so many men.

114
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,120
Were you afraid I'd take it by force?

115
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:51,040
President Du, you must be joking.

116
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:55,360
In business, trust must be paramount.

117
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:08,959
It's real.

118
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:11,920
President Du,

119
00:08:12,439 --> 00:08:15,079
since it's real,
you must honor your promise.

120
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,399
President Du,

121
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:23,839
what are you doing?

122
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:26,879
Don't tell me you don't intend
to keep your word.

123
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,559
Where's the thing inside it?

124
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,799
Hurry! Catch them!

125
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:14,919
Get them!

126
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,399
- After them!
- Stop!

127
00:09:16,879 --> 00:09:17,639
Catch them!

128
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,220
Hurry!

129
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,340
This way!

130
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:20,700
Stop!

131
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:21,259
Hurry!

132
00:09:28,399 --> 00:09:28,960
Up there!

133
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:29,799
After them!

134
00:09:30,399 --> 00:09:30,960
Over here!

135
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:25,039
(So the Buddha Head hid)

136
00:10:25,039 --> 00:10:28,559
(this strange stone that can
amplify senses and reveal visions.)

137
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:34,679
(This could only be the heavenly stone
spoken of in ancient records.)

138
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,919
(Before everything is clarified,)

139
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:42,360
(the heavenly stone and the Buddha Head
mustn't fall into the wrong hands.)

140
00:10:42,519 --> 00:10:44,000
Rong Xiaonan!

141
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:47,240
So I can see visions by touching

142
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,159
due to this heavenly stone inside.

143
00:10:50,039 --> 00:10:52,799
There was never a treasure map
inside the Buddha Head.

144
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:56,080
Now is not the time to talk about this.

145
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:56,879
Let's go.

146
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:05,399
Surround this place!

147
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,200
Yes!

148
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:09,480
Xu You'an, what are you doing?

149
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:33,440
♪As if it were fate♪

150
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:34,797
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

151
00:11:35,359 --> 00:11:38,596
♪We miss each other♪

152
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,408
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

153
00:11:41,408 --> 00:11:43,808
♪And a bizarre♪

154
00:11:43,808 --> 00:11:46,610
♪Anonymous legend♪

155
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:49,152
♪The plot twists and turns♪

156
00:11:49,300 --> 00:11:51,040
♪Play out over and over again♪

157
00:11:51,040 --> 00:11:54,104
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

158
00:11:54,685 --> 00:11:56,384
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

159
00:11:56,384 --> 00:11:57,376
♪Refuse to submit♪

160
00:11:57,376 --> 00:12:00,576
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

161
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:05,152
♪There are always too many♪

162
00:12:05,152 --> 00:12:07,040
♪Helpless situations♪

163
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:09,664
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

164
00:12:10,795 --> 00:12:12,755
♪Even if I have questions♪

165
00:12:12,755 --> 00:12:14,755
♪I harbor desires♪

166
00:12:14,755 --> 00:12:17,632
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

167
00:12:17,983 --> 00:12:19,616
♪People come and go♪

168
00:12:19,616 --> 00:12:22,432
♪I'm still all alone♪

169
00:12:22,432 --> 00:12:25,160
♪Wandering around♪

170
00:12:25,408 --> 00:12:28,261
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

171
00:12:28,261 --> 00:12:32,722
♪Go through the entanglement♪

172
00:12:33,088 --> 00:12:34,816
♪If longing♪

173
00:12:34,816 --> 00:12:37,975
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

174
00:12:37,975 --> 00:12:40,730
♪How can I be at ease♪

175
00:12:40,832 --> 00:12:43,146
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

176
00:12:43,264 --> 00:12:45,120
♪And travelled around the world♪

177
00:12:45,216 --> 00:12:48,304
♪Scars all over me♪

178
00:12:48,576 --> 00:12:51,488
♪If longing never fades♪

179
00:12:51,488 --> 00:12:52,937
♪Burns still hot♪

180
00:12:52,937 --> 00:12:56,016
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

181
00:12:56,288 --> 00:12:58,145
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

182
00:12:58,208 --> 00:12:59,392
♪In the next life♪

183
00:12:59,392 --> 00:13:03,872
♪Entangle with you again♪
